# BISTRO-NIGHT-LOOK (design F:/aftmp/DESIGN-BISTRO-NIGHT-LOOK.md, Приёмка): the Bistro night against the path tracer of
# this build, after the light visibility flag (D2), one exposure offset (D12, v78), shadowed coloured bulbs, emissive
# luminances, moon shadows, night fog, bloom and the after-rain street (content of F:/BistroFoliageProj).
# Numbers (Приёмка 3): linear L per region, 4x4 blocks. C1 S_hw vs S_pt facade/street/awning/hedge L +-25 %, R/G +-15 %;
# C2 shield B/G and R/G +-15 % of S_pt; C3 the K1/K4 shares; C4 emitters in cd/m2 +-20 % (lamp globe 3400, bulbs
# 4225 x Y-ratio, signs 300/800/150); C5 cypress S_hw <= S_pt +25 %; C6 day_B16 mean |d| <= 1/255 vs the pre-change
# build; C7 the profile-dump after S_hw and W_hw: GPU frame <= +2.0 ms vs before, [Memory] census within budget.
# Fog and bloom are off in every PT compare (D15: the PT has no fog). EV100 below is the probe's; acceptance writes the
# graded value here and in the PPV once (design 4.10). K3 (k_emissive_off_*, D1c) is not in this file: the control protocol has
# no asset subject (ControlProtocol.hpp kSubjects) and Material.setMaterialParam reaches slot 0 only - design, Поправки.
# day_B16 first: the day scene opens before any night edit, so no unsaved-scene question stands between them.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: TAA"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Когда frames 240
Тогда-вид day_B16 [day_B16] the B16 day street at the level's methods: mean |d| <= 1/255 against the same frame of the pre-change build (v78 and the visibility flag leave a day scene unchanged)
Когда run Scene "Open Scene GI_Bistro_Night.desce"
Когда frames 30
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.AutoExposure false
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ManualExposureEV100 0.5260688
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.EnableBloom false
Дано set 7130000000000010000 ExponentialHeightFogData.Enabled false
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид S_level [S_level] the level's own methods, fog and bloom off: facades, street, awning underside within +-35 % of S_pt
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид S_hw [S_hw] HW GI, shadows, reflections: the shield teal-grey as in S_pt, not blue; the cypress <= S_pt +25 %; facades, street, awning underside within +-25 % of S_pt
Когда profile-dump
